{"id":"36d645c141ea336a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SModel.md","title":"SModel","display":"SModel","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SModel","parameters":["F","R","f","r","D","I","J","K"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SModel"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>D</span><span>I</span><span>J</span><span>K</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：二阶语法与语义。有序参数：<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>D</code>、<code>I</code>、<code>J</code>、<code>K</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SModel F R f r D I J K)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists one (and (@ Num1 one) (and (@ FModel one F R f r D I J) (@ SRelDomains D K))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"debeca760396db21\" href=\"?note=debeca760396db21\" title=\"ZFC_FModel\">FModel</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6abf464803506304\" href=\"?note=6abf464803506304\" title=\"ZFC_Num1\">Num1</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"34e58e195eb37fee\" href=\"?note=34e58e195eb37fee\" title=\"ZFC_SRelDomains\">SRelDomains</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings"